-    *   `lr`: Initial learning rate scalar [S1][S2, unofficial].
-    *   `params`: Dictionary of scene parameters (e.g., MLP weights, positional encodings, appearance embeddings) [S1][S2, unofficial].
-    *   `loss`: Scalar loss value computed from the rendering equation [S1].
-    *   `step`: Current optimization step index [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Outputs:**
-    *   `params`: Updated parameters after one optimization step [S2, unofficial].
